    "30 days": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "30 Tagen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "90 days": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "90 Tagen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A change travels in the log; the other Mac picks it up on its own. Past entries keep showing the new name, because they refer to you rather than to a copy of your name.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine Änderung reist im Log mit, der andere Mac übernimmt sie von selbst. Alte Einträge zeigen den neuen Namen, weil sie auf dich verweisen und nicht auf eine Kopie deines Namens."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A folder that exists on both Macs. More can be added later.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein Ordner, der auf beiden Macs liegt. Weitere lassen sich später hinzufügen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A message becomes a task by ticking the box next to the text field before sending it. Open tasks from every project collect here until somebody ticks them off.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aus einer Nachricht wird eine Aufgabe, wenn du vor dem Senden das Häkchen neben dem Eingabefeld setzt. Offene Aufgaben aus allen Projekten sammeln sich hier, bis jemand sie abhakt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hinzufügen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add Project": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Projekt hinzufügen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add Project Folder…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Projektordner hinzufügen…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a project folder": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Einen Projektordner hinzufügen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add the usual four": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die üblichen vier anlegen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add your project folders once more. Everything written in them comes back from the folders themselves.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Füge deine Projektordner noch einmal hinzu. Alles, was darin geschrieben wurde, kommt aus den Ordnern selbst zurück."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add “%@” Anyway": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trotzdem „%@“ hinzufügen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add “%@”…": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "„%@“ hinzufügen…"
          }
        }
      }
