    "Both of you saved this file at the same time. Open the folder and keep the version you want.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ihr habt diese Datei gleichzeitig gespeichert. Öffne den Ordner und behalte die Fassung, die du willst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancel": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abbrechen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cannot open “%@”. The folder may have been moved, or it is on a volume that is not connected.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "„%@“ lässt sich nicht öffnen. Der Ordner wurde vielleicht verschoben oder liegt auf einem nicht verbundenen Volume."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Categories": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kategorien"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Change Stream": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Änderungsstrom"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Change stream": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Änderungsstrom"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Changed, newest first": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Geändert, neueste zuerst"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Changed, oldest first": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Geändert, älteste zuerst"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Changes are captured live only while the app runs. Anything that happens while it is closed is reconstructed on the next launch by comparing the folder, with approximate timestamps.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Live erfasst werden Änderungen nur bei laufender App. Was bei geschlossener App passiert, wird beim nächsten Start per Ordnerabgleich nachgetragen, mit ungefährem Zeitstempel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Changes seen just now. Quiet ones are gathered for twenty minutes so that a whole afternoon of saving becomes one line.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gerade gesehene Änderungen. Leise werden zwanzig Minuten gesammelt, damit ein ganzer Nachmittag Speichern eine Zeile wird."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Changes that arrived through sync. The other Mac is being given a moment to say who made them.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Änderungen, die über die Synchronisation kamen. Der andere Rechner bekommt kurz Zeit, zu sagen, von wem sie stammen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check Folder Now": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ordner jetzt prüfen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check the folder now": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ordner jetzt prüfen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checking what changed…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prüfe, was sich geändert hat…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose Folder…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ordner wählen…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a client or project folder. It will be watched, and its history kept in .macbench/ inside it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kunden- oder Projektordner wählen. Er wird beobachtet, sein Verlauf liegt in .macbench/ darin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a project folder": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Projektordner wählen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click Add Project to add “%@”. You are already in it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Klicke auf „Projekt hinzufügen“, um „%@“ hinzuzufügen. Du bist schon darin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Closing the window does not stop it: it keeps watching in the background, with no Dock icon. Open it again from the Finder or Spotlight. Started at login, it starts in the background.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Fenster zu schließen beendet die App nicht: Sie beobachtet ohne Dock-Symbol im Hintergrund weiter. Wieder öffnen lässt sie sich über den Finder oder Spotlight. Beim Anmelden gestartet, startet sie im Hintergrund."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Colour": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Farbe"
          }
