    "Off — only what we write": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aus — nur, was wir selbst schreiben"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One level, no sub-categories, and an entry can carry several. Categories are shared with everyone in the project. A new installation starts with none — the button offers Feedback, Technical, Admin and System if you want somewhere to begin.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine Ebene, keine Unterkategorien, ein Eintrag kann mehrere tragen. Kategorien gelten für alle im Projekt. Eine neue Installation startet ohne — der Knopf legt Feedback, Technik, Organisation und System an, falls du einen Anfang brauchst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One year": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
